# Git workflow

- Never commit or push directly to `main`.
- Before making changes, create a new branch from an up-to-date `main`
  (e.g. `git checkout main && git pull && git checkout -b <type>/<short-description>`).
- Make all changes and commits on that branch. Push the branch if asked.
- Do not merge the branch into `main`. The user reviews and merges it when ready.
